BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Life of Chuck
DTSTART:20250623T230000Z
DTEND:20250624T011000Z
DTSTAMP:20250623T230000Z
UID:Z6wNiSkq3a
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 110 mins (1h50m)\n\nFrom the hearts and minds of Ste
 phen King and Mike Flanagan comes The Life of Chuck\, the extraordinary st
 ory of an ordinary man. This unforgettable\, genre-bending tale celebrates
  the life of Charles 'Chuck' Krantz as he experiences the wonder of love\,
  the heartbreak of loss\, and the multitudes contained in all of us. Toro
 nto International Film Festival 2024 People's Choice Award winner.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/life-of-chuck
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brokeback Mountain
DTSTART:20250624T020000Z
DTEND:20250624T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20250624T020000Z
UID:KecBedr52y
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 134 mins (2h14m)\n\n“I wish I knew how to quit you
 .” Celebrate 20 years of Brokeback Mountain with SIFF. Ang Lee’s haunt
 ing\, tender story of forbidden love between two cowboys brought to life b
 y unforgettable performances from Heath Ledger and Jake Gyllenhaal\, was n
 othing short of revolutionary. A turning point for queer cinema and a land
 mark in American film\, Brokeback Mountain continues to move and challenge
  audiences two decades later. See it on the big screen while you can.\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/brokeback-mountain
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
