BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:All That Jazz
DTSTART:20250703T010000Z
DTEND:20250703T032500Z
DTSTAMP:20250703T010000Z
UID:vajHn3JlNb
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 123 mins (2h03m)\n\nSIFF Movie Club Director/choreog
 rapher Bob Fosse tells his own life story as he details the sordid life of
  Joe Gideon (Roy Scheider)\, a womanizing\, drug-using dancer. Introduced 
 by SIFF Development & Membership Manager Carson Rennekamp.\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/programs-and-events/siff-movie-club/all-that-jazz
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Know Your Place
DTSTART:20250706T020000Z
DTEND:20250706T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20250706T020000Z
UID:x5AjVwWeUZ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 118 mins (1h58m)\n\nSeattle’s issues with gentrifi
 cation and its impact on our East African community are explored as two te
 enage boys navigate the city to deliver a crucial and time-sensitive packa
 ge to a friend. 2022 Seattle International Film Festival Golden Space Need
 le Award - Best Film.  Director Zia Mohajerjasbi scheduled to attend for 
 post-film Q&A.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/know-your-place
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unstoppable
DTSTART:20250706T193000Z
DTEND:20250706T211500Z
DTSTAMP:20250706T193000Z
UID:fbNNIGdsIM
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 82 mins (1h22m)\n\nSlamdance Unstoppable: On the Roa
 d A showcase of short films made by filmmakers with visible and non-visibl
 e disabilities. Programmed exclusively by disabled artists\, Slamdance Uns
 toppable: On the Road aims to eliminate the prejudices and gate-keeping th
 at have historically kept disabled filmmakers from being represented in th
 e entertainment industry. View From the Floor directors Megan Griffiths a
 nd Mindie Lind scheduled to attend for post-screening Q&A.\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/slamdance-unstoppable-on-the-road/unstoppable-
 shorts
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Unstoppable Complicated
DTSTART:20250706T233000Z
DTEND:20250707T011500Z
DTSTAMP:20250706T233000Z
UID:eyLAaUO8Ka
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 83 mins (1h23m)\n\nSlamdance Unstoppable: On the Roa
 d In a failing healthcare system\, children with complex\, invisible illne
 ss and their families are labeled “too complicated” or torn apart by a
 ccusations of medical child abuse. Documentary feature. Director Andrew Ab
 rahams scheduled to attend for post-film Q&A.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cine
 ma/in-theaters/slamdance-unstoppable-on-the-road/complicated
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
